<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24840" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭolcos</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Iolcus</span></b> , i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰωλκός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town and harbor
				of Thessaly</i>, <i>in Magnesia</i>, <i>on the Pelasgic Gulf</i>, <i>whence
				Jason is said to have sailed with the Argonauts</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 44,
				13, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. Epod. 5, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 10,
				368</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 9,
				16, § 32</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭolcĭăcus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Iolcus</i>, <i>Iolchian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">portus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					7, 158</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">foci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 1, 56</span></i>
			 (54): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vota,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. Cir. 377</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ĭolci</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰωλκοί,</span>
			<i>the Iolchians</i>, <i><span class="en">Serv.
				Verg. E. 4, 34</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
